Package: GeneTrackR
Type: Package
Title: GenePred Gene Model and Genomic Signal Track Visualization
Version: 0.7.8
Authors@R: person("Rensc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rensc0718@163.com")
Description: Provides lightweight tools to read, validate, summarize, slice, merge,
    write, and visualize GenePred annotations and genomic signal tracks from
    bedGraph, wig, and bigWig files through a pure-R signal I/O layer. The
    package supports gene model plots,
    transcript plots, regional plots, signal coverage plots, and combined
    genome-browser-like track visualization.
